          "version": "7.0.1",
          "widget_ue_connectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Unet Loader (GGUF)\n### Download **qwen-image-Q8_0.gguf** from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/city96/Qwen-Image-gguf/resolve/main/qwen-image-Q8_0.gguf?download=true) or a smaller Q version from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/city96/Qwen-Image-gguf/tree/main)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models` \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Load CLIP\n\n###  Download **qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors** from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors) or a bigger model from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/tree/main/split_files/text_encoders)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/clip`  \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Load VAE\n\n### Download **qwen_image_vae.safetensors** vae model from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors)  \n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/vae`  \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Power Lora Loader\n\n### Download **Qwen-Image-Lightning-4steps-V1.0** lora model from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Lightning/resolve/main/Qwen-Image-Lightning-4steps-V1.0.safetensors?download=true)  \n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/loras`  \n\nMore info about lora [HERE](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Lightning/tree/main)\n\n---\n\n## 🆙 Load Upscale Model  \n\n### Download 4x_NMKD-Siax_200k.pth mode from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Akumetsu971/SD_Anime_Futuristic_Armor/resolve/main/4x_NMKD-Siax_200k.pth?download=true)  \n\n**Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/upscale_models`\n\n---\n\n## 🧩 Nodes Installed from Manager  \n\n- **ControlAltAI_Nodes**\n- **ComfyUI-Easy-Use**\n- **rgthree-comfy**\n- **ComfyUI-GGUF**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources  \n🎥 **Tutorials:** [Pixaroma YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma)  \n💬 **Community Discord:** [Join Here](https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3)\n\nLearn More about Qwen [HERE](https://blog.comfy.org/p/qwen-image-in-comfyui-new-era-of) and [HERE](https://github.com/ModelTC/Qwen-Image-Lightning/)\n"
      ],
