      "widgets_values": [
        "Title: Whimsical Blue Hedgehog Crafter in Cozy Watercolor Sewing Workshop, Pastel Illustration\n\nKeywords: hedgehog, workshop, watercolor, cozy, sewing, kitten, pastel, rustic, crafts, overalls, nostalgic, cute, interior, creative, soft\n\n===\n\nSoft watercolor illustration of a whimsical blue hedgehog-like character in a cozy, rustic crafting workshop, designed as an original, generic hedgehog and not resembling any known fictional character, in accordance with Adobe Stock guidelines on fictional IP. The scene uses gentle pastel tones and slightly blurred, bleeding edges typical of traditional watercolor on textured paper, with warm, nostalgic lighting that feels like a quiet afternoon in a creative studio.\n​​\n\nIn the foreground on the left, depict a small, standing blue hedgehog character with rounded, friendly features and stylized short spines that sweep backward, clearly distinct from any existing character designs. The hedgehog wears soft blue overalls over a light cream or pastel-yellow shirt, with a simple pocket and stitching details, and a delicate pink flower tucked behind one ear, adding a sweet, handmade touch. The character holds a small yellow bucket with both hands, angled slightly downward, while gazing toward the floor with a thoughtful, introspective expression, as if contemplating a new project or creative idea.\n​\n\nOn the right side of the foreground, place a sturdy wooden worktable in warm brown tones, its surface softly textured with watercolor grain. Perched on the tabletop is an orange-and-white kitten with soft fur, large curious eyes, and a relaxed posture, gently watching the hedgehog. The kitten’s tail curls around its paws or drapes over the edge of the table, reinforcing the calm, cozy mood.\n\nIn the mid-ground, fill the table surface with an assortment of crafting and sewing items rendered in soft, pastel colors. Include a pair of blue scissors, several colorful thread spools in pink, yellow, blue, and green, scattered buttons, and small fabric pieces in floral and checkered patterns, all painted with loose watercolor edges and subtle shadows. On the right side of the table sits a charming, slightly vintage sewing machine in a muted pastel tone, with more threads and buttons around its base, suggesting active, ongoing creative work. Shelves and side surfaces can hold jars, baskets, and more neatly organized supplies to enrich the storytelling without overcrowding the composition.\n\nIn the background, show rustic wooden walls partly covered by hanging fabric pieces and patchwork-style patterns that read almost like soft wallpaper, using pastel yellows, blues, pinks, and greens in stripes, dots, and florals. Above and behind the table, mount shelves holding bowls of fruit, small stuffed animals, folded fabrics, and additional sewing notions, all painted with simplified shapes and gentle color transitions so they support rather than dominate the scene. On one wall, include a window with pale wooden framing and soft, warm sunlight streaming through, casting a gentle glow and faint beams across the room to enhance the inviting atmosphere.​\n\nKeep the overall color palette dominated by soft yellows, baby blues, blush pinks, and light greens, with occasional accents of richer orange from the kitten and deeper blue from the hedgehog’s overalls to anchor the scene. Use layered washes and subtle gradients to create atmospheric depth, allowing edges to bloom and blur slightly, giving the entire workshop a dreamy, nostalgic feel. The mood should be warm, serene, and slightly whimsical, emphasizing creativity, comfort, and the quiet companionship between the hedgehog and the kitten in this pastel watercolor workshop interior."
      ]
